%N A399270 Number of nonnegative integer solutions to the equation x^2 + 9*y^2 = n.
%H A399270 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A399270/b399270.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%o A399270 (PARI) a(n, k=9) = sum(i=0, sqrtint(n), sum(j=0, sqrtint(n\k), i^2+k*j^2==n));
